fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gstmpegvideoparser.html#GstMpegVideoMeta","fragment":"\n\tGstMpegVideoMeta\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.MpegVideoMeta\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.MpegVideoMeta\n\nMembers\nExtra buffer metadata describing the contents of a MPEG1/2 Video frame\nCan be used by elements (mainly decoders) to avoid having to parse\nMpeg video 1/2 packets if it can be done upstream.\nThe various fields are only valid during the lifetime of the GstMpegVideoMeta.\nIf elements wish to use those for longer, they are required to make a copy.\nparent GstMeta\nthe GstMpegVideoSequenceHdr if present in the buffer\nthe GstMpegVideoSequenceExt if present in the buffer\nthe GstMpegVideoSequenceDisplayExt if present in the\nbuffer.\nthe GstMpegVideoPictureHdr if present in the buffer.\nthe GstMpegVideoPictureExt if present in the buffer.\nthe GstMpegVideoQuantMatrixExt if present in the buffer\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.2\n\t\t\nExtra buffer metadata describing the contents of a MPEG1/2 Video frame\nCan be used by elements (mainly decoders) to avoid having to parse\nMpeg video 1/2 packets if it can be done upstream.\nThe various fields are only valid during the lifetime of the GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoMeta.\nIf elements wish to use those for longer, they are required to make a copy.\nparent Gst.Meta\nthe GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoSequenceHdr if present in the buffer\nthe GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoSequenceExt if present in the buffer\nthe GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoSequenceDisplayExt if present in the\nbuffer.\nthe GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoPictureHdr if present in the buffer.\nthe GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoPictureExt if present in the buffer.\nthe GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoQuantMatrixExt if present in the buffer\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.2\n\t\t\nExtra buffer metadata describing the contents of a MPEG1/2 Video frame\nCan be used by elements (mainly decoders) to avoid having to parse\nMpeg video 1/2 packets if it can be done upstream.\nThe various fields are only valid during the lifetime of the GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoMeta.\nIf elements wish to use those for longer, they are required to make a copy.\nparent Gst.Meta\nthe GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoSequenceHdr if present in the buffer\nthe GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoSequenceExt if present in the buffer\nthe GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoSequenceDisplayExt if present in the\nbuffer.\nthe GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoPictureHdr if present in the buffer.\nthe GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoPictureExt if present in the buffer.\nthe GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoQuantMatrixExt if present in the buffer\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.2\n\t\t\n"});